-- National Insurance Law s 28 (חשבונות ענפי הביטוח, the branch accounts), with ss 28A and 28B, and s 32 (הקצבות אוצר המדינה למוסד, the
-- Treasury's allocations to the Institute). Row IL-34, priority 5. `src:N` is line N of the Law's deposited text
-- (../../registers/source-bundle/national-insurance-law-consolidated-version-5755-1995.he.wiki.txt, sha256 78bf47ee...2a97).
--
-- WHAT THEY SAY. A sum paid in contributions is credited to the branch accounts in proportion to the Schedule J rates (28(a)); each branch has its
-- own account, between which the Institute, with the Council's Finance Committee, may move items (28(b)); the general expenses are divided by
-- rules (28(d)). The Treasury allocates each fiscal year a percentage of the Institute's receipts in all branches and of its own monthly payments
-- (32(a)); a monthly payment of 7.10% of the employers' receipts and 5.65% of the self-employed's (32(c1)); a reimbursement for the growth of the
-- pensioner populations beyond the general population's, up to a ceiling (32(g)); and the sums spent under ss 74B and 74C (32(h)).
--
-- THE PERCENTAGES OF s 32(a). The numbered paragraphs print one percentage a year. Their present figures for 2025 to 2029 are enacted by two Acts that
-- are deposited: the National Insurance Law (Amendment No. 252 and temporary provision), Sefer HaChukim 3347 (25_lsr_5482787.pdf, sha256
-- d6c450ca...8904): s 2 sets 2025 at 47.07%; and the 2025 Budget-year Law, Sefer HaChukim 3384 (25_lsr_6133485.pdf, sha256 eba7e1fa...ecfa) s 19(1): 2026
-- 44.57%, 2027 55.40%, 2028 56.47%, 2029 on 56.52%, from 1.1.2026 (its s 21). Amendment 252's s 7(b) lets the Minister extend its temporary period
-- by order to 2027 and to 2028, a year at a time, and if he does the percentage for that year is 47.74% (2027) or 49.27% (2028), which the Budget-year
-- Law s 20(2) changes to 44.26% and 45.39%. Whether an order was made is a fact the caller reports. Years before 2018 are printed only in an editors'
-- note (2016, 2017) or not at all: NEEDS A SOURCE.

§ `Sections 28 and 32`

§§ `Section 28: the branch accounts`

-- src:448 | סעיף 28 – חשבונות ענפי הביטוח [תיקון: תשע״ו־4]
-- src:449 | (א) כל סכום שמשלמים למוסד כדמי ביטוח ייזקף לזכות חשבונות ענפי הביטוח השונים לפי יחס שיעורי דמי הביטוח הקבועים בלוח י׳, ואם לא שולמו דמי הביטוח במלואם יזקפו לזכות חשבונות ענפי הביטוח את הסכומים היחסיים.
-- src:450 | (ב) לכל ענף ביטוח יתנהל חשבון נפרד; המוסד, בהסכמת ועדת הכספים של המועצה, יהיה רשאי להעביר סעיף, זכות או חובה, מחשבון ענף ביטוח אחד לחשבון ענף ביטוח אחר.
-- src:451 | (ג) [note: (נמחק).]
-- src:452 | (ד) ההוצאות הכלליות והמשותפות לענפי הביטוח השונים יחולקו בין החשבונות של ענפי הביטוח לפי כללים שהמליצה עליהם המועצה לאחר קבלת חוות דעתו של האקטואר של המוסד ובאישור השר.

-- 28(a). A sum paid is credited to the branch accounts in proportion to the Schedule J rates; a part payment is credited by the same proportions.
-- The rates of the payer's column, by branch (maternity appears twice in Schedule J, so a branch's share is the sum of its entries) are the caller's.
@ref National Insurance Law s 28(a) (source line 449)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 28(a) credits in proportion to rates, and no rate was given` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 28(a) credits in proportion to rates, and no rate was given"

@ref National Insurance Law s 28(a) (source line 449)
GIVEN `the branch asked about` IS A `A branch of insurance`
      `the payment` IS A NUMBER
      `the rates` IS A LIST OF `A branch's rate in Schedule J`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28(a) — the sum credited to the account of the branch` `the branch asked about` `from a payment of` `the payment` `, the rates being` `the rates` MEANS
    IF `the total rate` EQUALS 0
    THEN `section 28(a) credits in proportion to rates, and no rate was given`
    ELSE (`the payment` TIMES `the rate of the branch`) DIVIDED BY `the total rate`
    WHERE
        `the total rate` MEANS sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the rate`) `the rates`)
        `the rate of the branch` MEANS sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the rate`) (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the branch` EQUALS `the branch asked about`) `the rates`))

-- Fork R1. The list form above is the ratio to the SUM of the rates given (it knows no printed total). A caller that has the column's printed total, which can differ from that
-- sum (Schedule J 2025-2026, employees above the tier), uses the forms below: the reading is a switch, declined where the two ratios give different amounts.
@ref NOTES.md fork R1
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 28(a) credits by the ratio of the rates and the printed total of the column differs from the sum of its cells, and the amounts differ` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 28(a) credits by the ratio of the rates and the printed total of the column differs from the sum of its cells, and the amounts differ"

@ref National Insurance Law s 28(a) (source line 449); NOTES.md fork R1
GIVEN `the branch asked about` IS A `A branch of insurance`
      `the payment` IS A NUMBER
      `the rates` IS A LIST OF `A branch's rate in Schedule J`
      `the printed total` IS A NUMBER
      r IS A `A reading of the ratio of the rates in section 28(a)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28(a) — the sum credited to the account of the branch` `the branch asked about` `from a payment of` `the payment` `, the rates being` `the rates` `and the printed total` `the printed total` `, reading the ratio as` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the ratio of each rate to the sum of the rates given`      THEN `by the cells`
    WHEN `the ratio of each rate to the printed total of the column` THEN `by the printed total`
    WHEN `the ratio of the rates is declined` THEN
        IF `by the cells` EQUALS `by the printed total`
        THEN `by the cells`
        ELSE `section 28(a) credits by the ratio of the rates and the printed total of the column differs from the sum of its cells, and the amounts differ`
    WHERE
        `by the cells` MEANS `s 28(a) — the sum credited to the account of the branch` `the branch asked about` `from a payment of` `the payment` `, the rates being` `the rates`
        `by the printed total` MEANS
            IF `the printed total` EQUALS 0
            THEN `section 28(a) credits in proportion to rates, and no rate was given`
            ELSE (`the payment` TIMES sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the rate`) (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the branch` EQUALS `the branch asked about`) `the rates`))) DIVIDED BY `the printed total`

@ref NOTES.md fork R1 (SHRUG, Meng 2026-10-08)
GIVETH A `A reading of the ratio of the rates in section 28(a)`
`s 28(a) — the reading this row takes of the ratio of the rates` MEANS `the ratio of the rates is declined`

@ref National Insurance Law s 28(a) (source line 449); NOTES.md fork R1
GIVEN `the branch asked about` IS A `A branch of insurance`
      `the payment` IS A NUMBER
      `the rates` IS A LIST OF `A branch's rate in Schedule J`
      `the printed total` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28(a) — the sum credited to the account of the branch` `the branch asked about` `from a payment of` `the payment` `, the rates being` `the rates` `and the printed total` `the printed total` MEANS
    `s 28(a) — the sum credited to the account of the branch` `the branch asked about` `from a payment of` `the payment` `, the rates being` `the rates` `and the printed total` `the printed total` `, reading the ratio as` (`s 28(a) — the reading this row takes of the ratio of the rates`)

-- 28(b). "The Institute, with the agreement of the Finance Committee of the Council, may move an item, credit or debit, from the account of one
-- branch to the account of another."
@ref National Insurance Law s 28(b) (source line 450)
GIVEN t IS A `A transfer between two branch accounts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28(b) — the transfer between two branch accounts is allowed` t MEANS
        t's `made by the Institute`
    AND t's `with the consent of the Finance Committee of the Council`
    AND NOT (t's `from the account of` EQUALS t's `to the account of`)

-- 28(d). The general and common expenses are divided by rules the Council recommends after the actuary's opinion, with the Minister's approval.
@ref National Insurance Law s 28(d) (source line 452)
GIVEN r IS A `A rule dividing the general expenses among the branch accounts`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28(d) — the rule dividing the general expenses is valid` r MEANS
        r's `recommended by the Council`
    AND r's `after the opinion of the Institute's actuary`
    AND r's `approved by the Minister`

§§ `Section 28A: the reserve-service account`

-- src:454 | סעיף 28א – הוראה מיוחדת [תיקון: תשנ״ט־6]
-- src:455 | על אף האמור בסעיף 28, הסכום שביום י״ג בטבת התשנ״ט (1 בינואר 1999) היה בחשבון ענף ביטוח שירות מילואים ייזקף, ביום האמור, לחשבון ענף ביטוח אבטלה; לענין סעיף זה, ”ענף ביטוח שירות מילואים“ – כמשמעותו בפרק ו׳4 לחוק הביטוח הלאומי [נוסח משולב], התשכ״ח–1968, כנוסחו ביום כ״ח בטבת התשנ״ה (31 בדצמבר 1994).

@ref National Insurance Law s 28A (source line 455)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 28A — the day the reserve-service account was folded into unemployment` MEANS
    YMD 1999 1 1

@ref National Insurance Law s 28A (source line 455)
GIVETH A `A branch of insurance`
`s 28A — the branch credited with the reserve-service account's balance on that day` MEANS
    `unemployment`

§§ `Section 28B: the unemployment deficit, 2000 to 2014`

-- src:457 | סעיף 28ב – הוראת שעה [תיקון: תש״ס־2, תשס״ב־6, תשס״ח־3, תשס״ט־4, תשע״א־3]
-- src:458 | על אף הוראות סעיפים 28 ו־33, בתקופה שמיום כ״ג בטבת התש״ס (1 בינואר 2000) ועד יום ט׳ בטבת התשע״ה (31 בדצמבר 2014), יחולו הוראות אלה לענין ענף ביטוח אבטלה –
-- src:459 | (1) ראה המוסד כי בחודש מסוים צפוי גירעון בענף ביטוח אבטלה, ייזקף באותו חודש הסכום החסר הצפוי מחשבון ענף ביטוח ילדים, בהתאם לאומדן הגירעון לאותו חודש;
-- src:460 | (2) עם פרסום מאזן המוסד לפי סעיף 31, ייערך חשבון סופי של הגירעון בענף ביטוח אבטלה בשנת הכספים שלגביה פורסם המאזן, והיתרה תועבר מחשבון ענף ביטוח ילדים או תוחזר לענף זה, לפי הענין;
-- src:461 | (3) לענין סעיף קטן זה, ”אומדן הגירעון“ – ההפרש שבין אומדן סכום הוצאות ענף ביטוח אבטלה הצפויות בחודש מסוים, לבין אומדן סכום התקבולים הצפויים מדמי ביטוח אבטלה באותו חודש, לרבות סכום השווה לחלק היחסי מהסכומים שאוצר המדינה שילם למוסד בעד אותו חודש לפי סעיף 32(ג1), המחושב לפי אומדן התקבולים לענף ביטוח אבטלה.

@ref National Insurance Law s 28B (source line 458)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 28B — the first day of the temporary provision` MEANS
    YMD 2000 1 1

@ref National Insurance Law s 28B (source line 458)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 28B — the last day of the temporary provision` MEANS
    YMD 2014 12 31

@ref National Insurance Law s 28B (source line 458)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 28B — the temporary provision applies on the day` d MEANS
        Day d AT LEAST Day (`s 28B — the first day of the temporary provision`)
    AND Day d AT MOST  Day (`s 28B — the last day of the temporary provision`)

-- 28B(3): "the estimate of the deficit" is the estimated expenses of the unemployment branch for a month less the estimated receipts from
-- unemployment contributions, including the proportional share of the Treasury's s 32(c1) payments for that month.
@ref National Insurance Law s 28B(3) (source line 461)
GIVEN `the estimated expenses of the month` IS A NUMBER
      `the estimated receipts of unemployment contributions` IS A NUMBER
      `the share of the s 32(c1) payments for the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28B(3) — the estimate of the deficit: expenses` `the estimated expenses of the month` `, receipts` `the estimated receipts of unemployment contributions` `, s 32(c1) share` `the share of the s 32(c1) payments for the month` MEANS
    `the estimated expenses of the month` MINUS (`the estimated receipts of unemployment contributions` PLUS `the share of the s 32(c1) payments for the month`)

-- 28B(1): when the Institute sees an expected deficit in a month, the missing sum is credited that month from the children's branch, by the estimate.
-- A month with no deficit (the estimate not above 0) has nothing to credit.
@ref National Insurance Law s 28B(1) (source line 459)
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      `the estimate of the deficit` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28B(1) — the sum credited from the children's branch in the month of` `the day` `, the estimate being` `the estimate of the deficit` MEANS
    IF `s 28B — the temporary provision applies on the day` `the day` AND `the estimate of the deficit` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN `the estimate of the deficit`
    ELSE 0

-- 28B(2): when the balance sheet is published, the final account of the deficit in the financial year is made: the difference between the actual
-- deficit of the year and what was credited, moved from the children's branch if positive, returned to it if negative.
@ref National Insurance Law s 28B(2) (source line 460)
GIVEN `the deficit of the financial year` IS A NUMBER
      `the sums credited during the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 28B(2) — the balance to move from the children's branch to unemployment (negative: to return), the deficit being` `the deficit of the financial year` `and the sums credited` `the sums credited during the year` MEANS
    `the deficit of the financial year` MINUS `the sums credited during the year`

§§ `Section 32(a): the Treasury's percentage`

-- src:476 | סעיף 32 – הקצבות אוצר המדינה למוסד [תיקון: תשס״ב־6, תשס״ב־12, תשס״ה־3, תשס״ז־2, תשס״ח־3, תשס״ח־5, תשע״א־3, תשע״ב־10, תשע״ב־15, תשע״ד־3, תשע״ו־4, תשע״ז־2, תשע״ז־6, תשע״ז־7, תשע״ז־12, תשע״ז־14, תשע״ז־15, תשע״ח־4, תשע״ח־6, ק״ת תש״ף־2, תש״ף־3, תש״ף־6, תשפ״א־10, תשפ״א־11, תשפ״א־12, תשפ״ב־3, תשפ״ג, תשפ״ג־2, תשפ״ד־2, תשפ״ד־9, תשפ״ה־3, תשפ״ה־7]
-- src:477 | (א) אוצר המדינה יקציב למוסד, לכל שנת כספים, סכום השווה לשיעור כמפורט להלן [note: (מינואר 2016 עד 1.12.2016, 45.1%; מיום 2.12.2016 עד 31.12.2016, 91.3%; בשנת 2017, 50.58%; מתחילת 2018 עד 28.2.2018, 51.94% ; בשנת 2019, 53.57% ; החל מיום 1.3.2018 החל משנת 2018 החל מיום 1.3.2018, כמפורט להלן)] מהתקבולים שגבה המוסד בכל ענפי הביטוח השונים כקבוע בלוח י׳ ומתשלומי אוצר המדינה לפי סעיף קטן (ג1); השר, באישור ועדת הכספים של הכנסת ובהסכמת שר האוצר, רשאי לשנות את השיעור הקבוע בסעיף קטן זה;
-- src:478 | (1) בשנת 2018 – 57.16 אחוזים;
-- src:479 | (2) בשנת 2019 – 55.96 אחוזים;
-- src:480 | (3) בשנת 2020 – 55.74 אחוזים;
-- src:481 | (4) בשנת 2021 – 57.26 אחוזים;
-- src:482 | (5) בשנת 2022 – 53.89 אחוזים;
-- src:483 | (6) בשנת 2023 – 58.88 אחוזים;
-- src:484 | (7) בשנת 2024 – 59.81 אחוזים;
-- src:485 | (8) בשנת 2025 – 47.07 אחוזים;
-- src:486 | (9) בשנת 2026 – 44.57 אחוזים;
-- src:487 | (10) בשנת 2027 – 55.40 אחוזים;
-- src:488 | (11) בשנת 2028 – 56.47 אחוזים;
-- src:489 | (12) בשנת 2029 ואילך – 56.52 אחוזים.

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(a) (source lines 477-489)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 32(a) as it stood before 2018 is printed only in an editors' note and is not deposited as law` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 32(a) as it stood before 2018 is printed only in an editors' note and is not deposited as law"

-- The percentage for a year. The extension flag matters only for 2027 and 2028 (Amendment 252 s 7(b)).
@ref National Insurance Law s 32(a)(1)-(12) (source lines 478-489); Amendment 252 s 2 and s 7(b), 2025 Budget-year Law ss 19(1), 20(2)
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the Minister extended the temporary period for the year by order` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(a) — the Treasury's percentage for the year` `the year` `, an order extending the temporary period being` `the Minister extended the temporary period for the year by order` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the year` LESS THAN 2018      THEN `section 32(a) as it stood before 2018 is printed only in an editors' note and is not deposited as law`
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2018         THEN 57.16
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2019         THEN 55.96
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2020         THEN 55.74
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2021         THEN 57.26
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2022         THEN 53.89
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2023         THEN 58.88
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2024         THEN 59.81
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2025         THEN 47.07
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2026         THEN 44.57
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2027         THEN (IF `the Minister extended the temporary period for the year by order` THEN 44.26 ELSE 55.40)
           IF `the year` EQUALS 2028         THEN (IF `the Minister extended the temporary period for the year by order` THEN 45.39 ELSE 56.47)
           OTHERWISE                              56.52

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(a) (source line 477)
GIVEN c IS A `A change of the Treasury's percentage in section 32(a)`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 32(a) — the change of the percentage is validly made` c MEANS
        c's `made by the Minister`
    AND c's `approved by the Finance Committee of the Knesset`
    AND c's `with the consent of the Minister of Finance`

-- "a sum equal to the percentage of the receipts the Institute collected in all the insurance branches ... and of the Treasury's payments under (c1)."
@ref National Insurance Law s 32(a) (source line 477)
GIVEN `the percentage` IS A NUMBER
      `the receipts of the year in all branches` IS A NUMBER
      `the Treasury's payments of the year under (c1)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(a) — the allocation for a year at` `the percentage` `per cent of receipts` `the receipts of the year in all branches` `and (c1) payments` `the Treasury's payments of the year under (c1)` MEANS
    `the percentage` DIVIDED BY 100 TIMES (`the receipts of the year in all branches` PLUS `the Treasury's payments of the year under (c1)`)

§§ `Section 32(c1): the monthly payment`

-- src:492 | (ג1)(1) נוסף על ההקצבות לפי סעיף קטן (א), יקציב אוצר המדינה למוסד, מדי חודש, סכום השווה לצירופם של שני אלה:
-- src:493 | (א) סכום השווה ל־7.10% מסך כל התקבולים שגבה המוסד ממעבידים בחודש שלגביו מחושב התשלום;
-- src:494 | (ב) סכום השווה ל־5.65% מסך כל התקבולים שגבה המוסד מעובדים עצמאיים בחודש שלגביו מחושב התשלום;
-- src:495 | הסכומים האמורים בסעיף קטן זה ובסעיף קטן (א) יחולקו בין ענפי הביטוח השונים כאמור בלוח י׳.
-- src:496 | (2) לענין סעיף קטן זה, ”תקבולים“ – כל התקבולים שגבה המוסד לפי הוראות חוק זה.

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(c1)(1) (source lines 492-494)
GIVEN `the receipts from employers in the month` IS A NUMBER
      `the receipts from the self-employed in the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(c1)(1) — the monthly payment: receipts from employers` `the receipts from employers in the month` `and from the self-employed` `the receipts from the self-employed in the month` MEANS
    7.10% TIMES `the receipts from employers in the month` PLUS 5.65% TIMES `the receipts from the self-employed in the month`

§§ `Section 32(g): the reimbursement, and its ceiling`

-- src:502 | (ז)(1) אוצר המדינה ישפה את המוסד, בכל שנת כספים, בסכומים אלה:
-- src:503 | (א) סכום השווה למכפלת שני אלה:
-- src:504 | (1) ההפרש בין שיעור הגידול באוכלוסיית זכאי קצבאות האזרח הוותיק והשאירים ובין שיעור הגידול באוכלוסייה הכללית בשנה הקודמת, כפי שמפרסמת הלשכה המרכזית לסטטיסטיקה;
-- src:505 | (2) סך קצבאות האזרח הוותיק והשאירים ששולמו בשנה הקודמת;
-- src:506 | (ב) סכום השווה למכפלת שני אלה:
-- src:507 | (1) ההפרש בין שיעור הגידול באוכלוסיית זכאי קצבת סיעוד ובין שיעור הגידול באוכלוסייה הכללית בשנה הקודמת, כפי שמפרסמת הלשכה המרכזית לסטטיסטיקה;
-- src:508 | (2) סך קצבאות הסיעוד ששולמו בשנה הקודמת.
-- src:509 | (2) סכום השיפוי לפי פסקה (1) לא יעלה על 750 מיליון שקלים חדשים בשנה (בסעיף זה – התקרה); התקרה תתעדכן ב־1 בינואר של כל שנה, לפי שיעור עליית המדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני אותו מועד לעומת המדד שפורסם לאחרונה לפני 1 בינואר של השנה הקודמת.

@ref NOTES.md fork S1
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 32(g)(1) multiplies a difference of growth rates and does not say what a negative product reimburses` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 32(g)(1) multiplies a difference of growth rates and does not say what a negative product reimburses"

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(g)(1) (source lines 503-508); NOTES.md fork S1
GIVEN `the growth of the entitled population` IS A NUMBER
      `the growth of the general population` IS A NUMBER
      `the pensions paid in the previous year` IS A NUMBER
      r IS A `A reading of a negative growth difference in section 32(g)(1)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(g)(1) — one limb of the reimbursement: entitled growth` `the growth of the entitled population` `, general growth` `the growth of the general population` `, pensions paid` `the pensions paid in the previous year` `, reading a negative product as` r MEANS
    IF `the product` AT LEAST 0
    THEN `the product`
    ELSE
        CONSIDER r
        WHEN `a negative product leaves nothing to reimburse` THEN 0
        WHEN `a negative product is taken as it comes`        THEN `the product`
        WHEN `a negative product is declined`                 THEN `section 32(g)(1) multiplies a difference of growth rates and does not say what a negative product reimburses`
    WHERE
        `the product` MEANS (`the growth of the entitled population` MINUS `the growth of the general population`) TIMES `the pensions paid in the previous year`

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(g)(1)-(2) (source lines 503-509); NOTES.md fork S1
GIVEN `the ceiling for the year` IS A NUMBER
      r IS A `A reading of a negative growth difference in section 32(g)(1)`
      d IS A `The data for the reimbursement under section 32(g)(1)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(g) — the reimbursement for a year, the ceiling being` `the ceiling for the year` `, reading a negative product as` r `, the data` d MEANS
    min `the ceiling for the year`
        (  `s 32(g)(1) — one limb of the reimbursement: entitled growth` (d's `the rate of growth of the population entitled to old-age and survivors pensions`) `, general growth` (d's `the rate of growth of the general population`) `, pensions paid` (d's `the old-age and survivors pensions paid in the previous year`) `, reading a negative product as` r
         PLUS
           `s 32(g)(1) — one limb of the reimbursement: entitled growth` (d's `the rate of growth of the population entitled to a long-term care pension`) `, general growth` (d's `the rate of growth of the general population`) `, pensions paid` (d's `the long-term care pensions paid in the previous year`) `, reading a negative product as` r)

@ref NOTES.md fork S2
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`section 32(g)(2) updates the ceiling by the rate of rise of the index and says nothing of a fall` MEANS
    REFUSE "section 32(g)(2) updates the ceiling by the rate of rise of the index and says nothing of a fall"

-- (2): the ceiling, updated each 1 January by the rate of rise of the index last published before it against the index last published before 1 January
-- of the previous year. The ceiling's first value (750 million shekels in the year of the provision) and that year are not in the text; the update step is.
@ref National Insurance Law s 32(g)(2) (source line 509); NOTES.md fork S2
GIVEN `the ceiling of the year before` IS A NUMBER
      `the index last published before 1 January of the year before` IS A NUMBER
      `the index last published before 1 January` IS A NUMBER
      r IS A `A reading of a fall in the index for the ceiling in section 32(g)(2)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(g)(2) — the ceiling updated from` `the ceiling of the year before` `by the index from` `the index last published before 1 January of the year before` `to` `the index last published before 1 January` `, reading a fall as` r MEANS
    IF `the index last published before 1 January` AT LEAST `the index last published before 1 January of the year before`
    THEN `the ceiling of the year before` TIMES (`the index last published before 1 January` DIVIDED BY `the index last published before 1 January of the year before`)
    ELSE
        CONSIDER r
        WHEN `a fall in the index leaves the ceiling where it was` THEN `the ceiling of the year before`
        WHEN `a fall in the index lowers the ceiling`              THEN `the ceiling of the year before` TIMES (`the index last published before 1 January` DIVIDED BY `the index last published before 1 January of the year before`)
        WHEN `a fall in the index is declined for the ceiling`     THEN `section 32(g)(2) updates the ceiling by the rate of rise of the index and says nothing of a fall`

@ref NOTES.md fork S1 (SHRUG, Meng 2026-10-08)
GIVETH A `A reading of a negative growth difference in section 32(g)(1)`
`s 32(g)(1) — the reading this row takes of a negative product` MEANS `a negative product is declined`

@ref NOTES.md fork S2 (SHRUG, Meng 2026-10-08)
GIVETH A `A reading of a fall in the index for the ceiling in section 32(g)(2)`
`s 32(g)(2) — the reading this row takes of a fall in the index` MEANS `a fall in the index is declined for the ceiling`

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(g) (source lines 502-509); NOTES.md fork S1
GIVEN `the ceiling for the year` IS A NUMBER
      d IS A `The data for the reimbursement under section 32(g)(1)`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(g) — the reimbursement for a year, the ceiling being` `the ceiling for the year` `, the data` d MEANS
    `s 32(g) — the reimbursement for a year, the ceiling being` `the ceiling for the year` `, reading a negative product as` (`s 32(g)(1) — the reading this row takes of a negative product`) `, the data` d

@ref National Insurance Law s 32(g)(2) (source line 509)
GIVEN `the ceiling of the year before` IS A NUMBER
      `the index last published before 1 January of the year before` IS A NUMBER
      `the index last published before 1 January` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(g)(2) — the ceiling updated from` `the ceiling of the year before` `by the index from` `the index last published before 1 January of the year before` `to` `the index last published before 1 January` MEANS
    `s 32(g)(2) — the ceiling updated from` `the ceiling of the year before` `by the index from` `the index last published before 1 January of the year before` `to` `the index last published before 1 January` `, reading a fall as` (`s 32(g)(2) — the reading this row takes of a fall in the index`)

§§ `Section 32(c2) and (h): reimbursements of expenses`

-- src:497 | (ג2) אוצר המדינה ישפה את המוסד על ההוצאות שהוציא למתן מענק אשפוז לפי הוראות לוח ב׳1.
-- src:510 | (ח) אוצר המדינה ישפה את המוסד, בכל שנת כספים, על הסכומים שהוציא בשל סעיפים 74ב(ה) ו־74ג(א).

-- (c2) and (h): the Treasury reimburses the Institute the expenses it incurred (a hospitalisation grant under Schedule B1; the sums under ss 74B(e)
-- and 74C(a)). The amount is the Institute's expense; the section adds no formula.
@ref National Insurance Law s 32(c2) and (h) (source lines 497, 510)
GIVEN `the expenses the Institute incurred` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 32(c2) and (h) — the reimbursement of expenses of` `the expenses the Institute incurred` MEANS
    `the expenses the Institute incurred`
